# [WORKSPACE_NAME] Workspace — Claude Code Instructions

This is a workspace dispatcher. Read AGENTS.md to identify which platform the
task belongs to, then work within that subdir.

Claude Code specifics:
- Workspace-level rules in `.claude/rules/` (routing only — no enforcement).
- Each subdir has its own `.claude/rules/`, `.claude/hooks/`, `.claude/skills/`.
- When cd'ing into a subdir, Claude Code will pick up that subdir's native configs.
